{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_4_001_10_c",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:acd9bdebd0b67d2ca39a3ffe0b4d38a41f02323688a0578b452d159916f2f27a",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_c:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bab19f4c666865cee48783a771bc39e49ec361e092bcc8bb9c46e4eb1b07bb0f",
      "text": "虽说到今天为止经历过很多大风大浪，\n但这也算是其中最大的舞台了啊……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_c:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ffd29ed959257c8f59e0931749229842d203752f251f33dc57b69dd200086632",
      "text": "话说回来，被你这么一吐槽我反而更紧张了。\n别对我恩将仇报啊，我可是给你泡了咖啡的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_c:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1cacd902aeb501894fe925f76bcb7a528bd81f39f32b3364a2a024b13facb87a",
      "text": "对、对不起。\n我还以为说出来会轻松一些呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_c:cmd-000065:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fbbc0db09e47b8d4fec4ce1e96d125e89f1109fda54e54c1f7b00367e8975ddc",
      "text": "没事的啦，秀。我也很紧张嘛。不过，\n我比紧张更期待演出开始呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_c:cmd-000079:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b0994f4bb999310c1c01e40bf5169a26e77c06cc839c6653efe2458c37004dd9",
      "text": "我懂的，天道。\n毕竟走到这一步，都是大家一起努力过来的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_c:cmd-000087:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fb032700f93eb1d507f15eefc2780f7130099b0f0c6091e91a1f8903cfc5cabf",
      "text": "能把自己掌握的实力在舞台上毫无保留地展现出来。\n一想到这里，整个人都兴奋起来了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_c:cmd-000100:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ff3e5ba8e349bea7ba8d60cb277cea311883e946d0cd92db80694a7113e9c7fb",
      "text": "我也是，我也是！\n走到今天为止，大家一起努力完成了好多好多事情！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_c:cmd-000108:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:339e87ca618414ed564c2caf7a32652d88b0ef5b291478ea4fb9091df4681dfb",
      "text": "在唱片店当了一日店长。\n在店内广播的工作里，也学到了好多好多词汇！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_c:cmd-000120:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7b46d43a2ed641739508f18f14aefd60e7af5afed1c8634964ac431827447d34",
      "text": "也有人说是因为那份工作认识了我们，\n进而成为我们的粉丝呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_c:cmd-000126:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8570ac6949263f0881869c30a2d079ef456a878223326fec2fc1ba3914881eef",
      "text": "这些事，要是去告诉还在便利店打工时的\n我，他肯定不会相信的吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_10:1_4_001_10_c:cmd-000137:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9c7687e57b563f7adef79513f00d58eac1b3d66594702af4d288808699ff2d96",
      "text": "那时候，我们让大家都露出了笑容。\n所以今天在Live上，也一定能带来满满的笑容！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
